msgstr "ይህን ሲግናል ይጥፋ?"

msgid "You are about to permanently remove this broadcast from the ecosystem. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "ይህን ብሮድካስት ከኤኮሲስተሙ በቋሚነት ሊያጠፉት ነው። ድርጊቱ ወደኋላ አይመለስም።"

msgid "Yes, Delete It"
msgstr "አዎ፣ ይጥፋ"

msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "ይቆይ"

msgid "Back to Community Posts"
msgstr "ወደ ኮሚኒቲ ፖስቶች ተመለስ"

msgid "Co-Founder Role"
msgstr "የተባባሪ መስራች ድርሻ"

msgid "Professional"
msgstr "ባለሙያ (Professional)"

msgid "What I'm Looking For"
msgstr "እኔ የምፈልገው"

msgid "Share Post"
msgstr "ፖስት ያጋሩ"

msgid "Message Author"
msgstr "ለጸሃፊው መልዕክት ይላኩ"

msgid "Link Copied to Clipboard"
msgstr "ሊንኩ ኮፒ ተደርጓል"

msgid "Edit Your Post"
msgstr "ፖስትዎን ያስተካክሉ"

msgid "What are you building?"
msgstr "ምን እየገነቡ ነው?"

msgid "Choose the category that best describes your initiative. This helps us ensure the right partners, co-founders, and resources find you."
msgstr "ስራዎን በተሻለ የሚገልጸውን ዘርፍ ይምረጡ። ይህም ትክክለኛ አጋሮች እንዲያገኙዎት ይረዳል።"

msgid "Are you building a scalable startup or a new business? Select this to share your grand vision and attract potential co-founders or investors."
msgstr "ስታርትአፕ ወይም አዲስ ቢዝነስ እየገነቡ ነው? ራዕይዎን ለማጋራት እና ኢንቨስተሮችን ለመሳብ ይህን ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Working on an open-source tool, a research paper, or a one-off collaboration? Outline it here so specialists can jump in and help you."
msgstr "በአንድ ፕሮጀክት ወይም ጥናት ላይ እየሰሩ ነው? ባለሙያዎች እንዲረዱዎት እዚህ ይግለጹት።"

msgid "Provide as much context as possible. Great descriptions attract great partners."
msgstr "የሚቻል ከሆነ ሰፊ መረጃ ይስጡ። ጥሩ መግለጫዎች ጥሩ አጋሮችን ይስባሉ።"

msgid "Change Category"
msgstr "ካቴጎሪ ይቀይሩ"

msgid "Give your post a clear headline"
msgstr "ለፖስትዎ ግልጽ ርዕስ ይስጡት"

msgid "Make it catchy and descriptive. This is the first thing people will see in the community pool."
msgstr "ሳቢ እና ገላጭ ያድርጉት። ሰዎች መጀመሪያ የሚያዩት ይህንን ነው።"

msgid "Tell us about your vision"
msgstr "ስለ ራዕይዎ ይንገሩን"

msgid "Explain exactly what you are building. What problem does it solve? Who is it for? Share your passion and let others see why this matters."
msgstr "ምን እየገነቡ እንደሆነ ያብራሩ። ምን ችግር ይፈታል? ለማን ነው? ፍላጎትዎን ያጋሩ።"

msgid "Current Stage"
msgstr "የአሁኑ ደረጃ"

msgid "Where are you right now?"
msgstr "አሁን የት ላይ ነዎት?"

msgid "Partnership Required"
msgstr "የሚፈለግ አጋርነት"

msgid "What kind of commitment do you need?"
msgstr "ምን ዓይነት ቁርጠኝነት ይፈልጋሉ?"

msgid "Who exactly are you looking for?"
msgstr "በትክክል ማንን ነው የሚፈልጉት?"

msgid "Describe the ideal partner. Mention specific skills, programming languages, marketing experience, or personality traits you need to succeed."
msgstr "ተመራጭ አጋርዎን ይግለጹ። ለስኬትዎ የሚፈልጓቸውን ልዩ ክህሎቶች እና ልምዶች ይጥቀሱ።"

msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "ለውጦችን ያስቀምጡ"

msgid "Publish to Community Pool"
msgstr "ለኮሚኒቲው ይፋ ያድርጉ"

msgid "e.g. Building an AI-driven logistics platform for East Africa"
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ ለምስራቅ አፍሪካ በ AI የሚመራ የሎጂስቲክስ ፕላትፎርም መገንባት"

msgid "e.g. Supply chain inefficiencies are causing massive delays. We are building a mobile-first app that connects truck drivers directly with local businesses..."
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ የጭነት መኪና አሽከርካሪዎችን ከቢዝነሶች ጋር የሚያገናኝ አፕ እየገነባን ነው..."

msgid "e.g. I need a technical co-founder with a strong background in Django and React Native. You should be passionate about logistics and ready to hustle."
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ በ Django እና React Native ልምድ ያለው ተባባሪ መስራች እፈልጋለሁ።"

msgid "e.g. Developing an open-source UI component library"
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ ክፍት (Open-source) የ UI ላይብረሪ ማበልጸግ"

msgid "e.g. Im creating a free library of accessible UI components for developers. The goal is to build 50 core components in the next 3 months..."
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ ለዴቨሎፐሮች ነጻ የ UI ላይብረሪ እያዘጋጀሁ ነው። ግቡ በሚቀጥሉት 3 ወራት..."

msgid "e.g. Im looking for UX designers who can review the accessibility of the components, and a few junior devs who want to help write documentation."
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ የUX ዲዛይነሮችን እና ዶክመንቴሽን ለመፃፍ የሚረዱ ጀማሪ ዴቨሎፐሮችን እፈልጋለሁ።"

msgid "Back to Marketplace"
msgstr "ወደ ገበያ ማዕከል ተመለስ"

msgid "Proof of Work Required"
msgstr "የስራ ማስረጃ ያስፈልጋል"

